### Create a product
POST http://localhost:8081/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "USB cable",
  "price": 9.50,
  "availableQuantity": 5
}

### Read the product
GET http://localhost:8081/api/products/{{productId}}

### Change the current price. Existing orders keep the purchase price.
PATCH http://localhost:8081/api/products/{{productId}}/price
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 12.00
}

### Place an order. The client does not send a price.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: order-demo-001
X-Correlation-Id: demo-correlation-001

{
  "customerEmail": "buyer@example.com",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "{{productId}}",
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

### Repeat the same key and body. Returns the existing order.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: order-demo-001
X-Correlation-Id: demo-correlation-001

{
  "customerEmail": "buyer@example.com",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "{{productId}}",
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

### Same key, different quantity. Expect 409.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: order-demo-001

{
  "customerEmail": "buyer@example.com",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "{{productId}}",
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

### Read the order
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/{{orderId}}

### Read the reservation decision
GET http://localhost:8081/api/reservations/{{orderId}}

### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

GET http://localhost:8081/actuator/health
